            "snippets": [
              "# Is Trump Choosing Tariffs Over a Trade Deal With China?\n## The tariffs were supposed to create the conditions for such a deal, but Trump is refusing to drop them as part of an agreement.\nPresident Donald Trump says he is unwilling to roll back any of the tariffs his administration has placed on Chinese imports as part of a \"phase one\" trade deal. Although the framework of a deal has been announced by leaders in both countries—and despite the fact that plans to sign the deal are already being made—Trump's unwillingness to withdraw any tariffs appears to be a major stumbling block toward actually reaching an agreement",
